## Test, lint & type-check caches, and local coverage/report output.
# All of these regenerate from a normal `pytest` / `ruff` / `mypy` /
# `playwright test` run, so committing them only ever produces churn. They
# were sitting untracked-but-unignored, which is how 381 MB of .mypy_cache
# accumulated without anyone noticing.
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/

